# Mariachi Framework

The docs are in `packages/core/docs/` (start at `packages/core/docs/README.md`). Before writing code, read:

- `packages/core/docs/architecture.md`: layers, project layout, import boundaries
- `packages/core/docs/conventions.md`: rules enforced by `mariachi validate` and `pnpm lint:conventions`
- `packages/core/docs/patterns.md`: composition root, DI, context, errors, idempotency
- `packages/core/docs/packages.md`: package catalog (generated; status and entry points)
- `packages/core/docs/ai-guide.md`: which piece to use, and common mistakes
- `packages/core/docs/recipes/`: step-by-step guides

## Critical rules

- `ctx` first, always: `communication.call(ctx, 'domain.action', input)`, `jobs.enqueue(ctx, ...)`, handlers `(ctx, input)`
- Controllers never import services or database packages
- Throw `MariachiError` subclasses with a `code`, never raw `Error`
- No `process.env` outside `@mariachi/config`
- Relative imports are extensionless
- Zod at boundaries (routes, procedures, jobs, events, config)
- Use factories (`createCache`, `createEventBus`, `createJobQueue`), not adapter constructors
- `apps/` and `examples/` are stale; don't copy from them
